    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><em>护甲（轻甲），珍稀（需同调）</em><br />这套奇形怪状的黑白色调护甲铸成于 <strong>堕影冥界Shadowfell</strong> 之中，它充满着那个可怕位面的幽影能量。<br />穿着这套护甲期间，你为防止陷入或结束 <strong>恐慌Frightened</strong> 状态所做的豁免具有优势。<br />这套护甲具有3发充能。你可以消耗一发充能以用其施展法术<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.new-icon.Item.6MYwBtZurc8Zw1ac]{安定心神 Calm Emotions}</em>（豁免DC15）。这套护甲在每日黎明时分恢复[[/r 1d3]]发已消耗的充能数。</p><p><span style=\"font-family:'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif\">该护甲的护胸和护肩由通过油煮硬化的皮子制成。护甲的其余部分则由更软更灵活的材料制作。</span></p><p>This intricate grayscale armor was forged in the Shadowfell and is infused with that plane's gloom.</p><p>While you're wearing this armor, you have advantage on saving throws you make to avoid or end the frightened condition on yourself.</p><p>This armor has 3 charges. You can expend a charge to cast the @spell[Calm Emotions] spell (save DC <span class=\"rd__dc\">15</span>) from the armor. This armor regains [[/r 1d3]] expended charges daily at dawn.</p><p>The breastplate and shoulder protectors of this armor are made of leather that has been stiffened by being boiled in oil. The rest of the armor is made of softer and more flexible materials.</p></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
